 "Mirroring training photos doubles the data, but a mirrored left knee is a right knee. Forget to swap the labels, and the legs swap.": "c534b1f772.mp3",
 "With two runners side by side, cropping a box per person lets one runner's limbs land on the other. Finding every joint first, then grouping them, keeps them apart.": "c9c959facf.mp3"
